d25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786671751003580001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c7c31423-d9c4-4923-9034-27768b391fe0","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"4f50-b1f2-78af-4326"}],"description":"## Context\nThe session-scoped `run_request_sites` fixture in `tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py` costs 46.95-49.02s setup in each Ubuntu CI cell. The earlier `analogical-dashing-fennecfox` ticket cached parsing, but runtime profiling still records about 9.54 million `ast.walk` iterations and 130.9 million calls. `_verdict` repeatedly rebuilds parent maps and rescans every source tree to rediscover callers. Focused local setup is 3.37s. Session-scoped/indexed invariants match pytest, Django, and Pylint/Astroid practice; no prior rejection was found.\n\n## Plan\n- Freeze the current exact ordered set of 24 `(key, config expression, verdict)` results and all existing provenance guards.\n- Add a deterministic work-budget oracle around a representative provenance run that fails when callers/parents are rediscovered by whole-tree walks.\n- Build immutable per-process parent/enclosing-function and call-site indices from the already cached parsed trees, then make `_verdict` query those indices.\n- Run held-out RED→GREEN, defect-seeded removal of the index, the full subcall-class suite, repository gates, and paired cold-process timing. Back-out is a Gerrit revert.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The exact current 24 provenance tuples and every existing guard verdict remain unchanged.\n- [ ] Each parsed source tree contributes to caller and parent indexing once per pytest process.\n- [ ] A deterministic oracle fails when whole-tree caller/parent rediscovery is reintroduced.\n- [ ] Removing the indices returns the held-out oracle to RED.\n- [ ] Paired cold-process timing quantifies setup and Ubuntu runner-time savings.\n- [ ] No production file or public API changes.\n- [ ] Focused tests, lint, typecheck, Gerrit LLM-Review +1, and Gerrit Verified +1 pass before merge.\n- [ ] The final ticket comment records RED/GREEN/mutation evidence and measured savings.","env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py","reason":"Build immutable caller/parent indices once and preserve exact provenance verdict coverage."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ci","performance","ubuntu","test","ast"],"ticket_id":"f94a-7cbc-72f2-4e6b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Index AST provenance callers and parents once","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["815c73e0-19e6-40e3-bbf4-3910a1f1b53a","ad904716-ccdf-4b6b-9681-890e0d4a7d7a","c7c31423-d9c4-4923-9034-27768b391fe0"]},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786676751048995001,"uuid":"2886c69e-f9d9-49fa-8415-0d52ca79e50e"}